                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The art style is good, reminds me of old shockwave games.  But I only made it a few levels before I wanted nothing more to do with it.  The level design is... a choice.  You're going up these platforms, or down, and need to walk off at the right time in order to make it to the next.  Thing is, you don't see those platforms when going down and have to guess at the time to walk off.  Too early?  Dead.  Too late?  Believe it or not, dead.\n\nIf it's this frustrating early on I cannot imagine it gets any better.",
